msgid "⚠️ 蓝牙控制器配置错误！\n\n设备路径 %s 是 KOReader 已打开的系统设备「%s」（如触摸屏或电源键），而非蓝牙控制器。\n\n请先连接手柄，然后在菜单「蓝牙控制器 → 已配对蓝牙设备」中选择它。"
msgstr "⚠️ Bluetooth Controller config error!\n\nDevice path %s is a system device \"%s\" already opened by KOReader (e.g., touchscreen or power button), not a Bluetooth controller.\n\nConnect your controller first, then pick it under \"Bluetooth Controller → Paired Bluetooth Devices\"."

