msgid "此设备型号（%s）不受支持。旧款 Kindle（如 KO、KPW3）使用此方法可能导致白屏，已取消。"
msgstr "This device model (%s) is not supported. On older Kindles (e.g. KO, KPW3) this method may cause a white screen, so it was cancelled."

msgid "将修改 Kindle 系统文件以支持蓝牙手柄/键盘：\n\n• 安装输入设备识别脚本和 udev 规则\n• 关闭蓝牙断开时产生的核心转储日志\n\n设备型号：%s\n仅在 Kindle 2024、KPW5、KPW6 及更新机型上验证过。\n\n是否继续？"
msgstr "This will modify Kindle system files to support Bluetooth controllers/keyboards:\n\n• Install the input device detection script and udev rule\n• Disable core dump logs created when Bluetooth disconnects\n\nDevice model: %s\nOnly verified on Kindle 2024, KPW5, KPW6 and newer.\n\nContinue?"

msgid "准备"
msgstr "Prepare"

